---

### 🛒 Grocito — Grocery Delivery System

A full-stack grocery delivery application developed using Spring Boot, React.js and MySQL with backend APIs and role-based functionality.

**Tech Stack**

`Java` `Spring Boot` `React.js` `MySQL` `REST APIs`

---

### 📊 Project Monitoring & Productivity Analytics

A project monitoring system designed to manage projects and tasks while providing real-time project activity and productivity information.

**Tech Stack**

`Java` `Spring Boot` `React.js` `MongoDB` `WebSocket` `Docker`

---

### 🌊 AquaAlert — Urban Flood Risk Prediction

An AI-based urban flood risk prediction and early warning system exploring rainfall forecasting, environmental factors and computer vision.

**Tech Stack**

`Python` `LSTM` `XGBoost` `ResNet50` `U-Net` `Grad-CAM`

---

### 👁️ AI-Based Glaucoma Detection

A deep learning research project focused on glaucoma detection using retinal fundus images and deep learning-based classification and segmentation approaches.

**Tech Stack**

`Python` `Deep Learning` `Computer Vision` `CNN` `YOLO` `U-Net`

---

### 🤖 RAG Chatbot Microservice

A retrieval-augmented generation based document search microservice developed using FastAPI and a vector database.

**Tech Stack**

`Python` `FastAPI` `RAG` `ChromaDB` `REST API`

